Matt,

You need to extract the proper data.frame.  If MT is an observation
level covariate, do

   obsCovs(umf)$MT <- relevel(obsCovs(umf)$MT, ref = "NH")

If MT is a site-level covariate, do

  siteCovs(umf)$MT <- relevel(siteCovs(umf)$MT, ref = "NH")

Hope that helps,
Ian

